{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Write this as a memorial in the book.</b> The passage of זכור (Deuteronomy 25:17–19)." "<b>And put it in the ears of Joshua.</b> And put some remembrance in the ears of Joshua — and this Moses did through the building of the altar and through his prayer at that time, and in what he said: כִּי יָד עַל כֵּס יָהּ." "<b>I will utterly erase the remembrance of Amalek.</b> Including even their cattle, as it says (1 Samuel 15:3): וְהַחֲרַמְתֶּם אֶת כָּל אֲשֶׁר לוֹ מִשּׁוֹר עַד שֶׂה וְכוּ׳."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:59.960919796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}